Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(engine): compile agentic-browser on Linux

The agent-browser port had a Linux fallback for most native calls; give the
remaining ones the same: screenshot sources are refused, mark targets and the
visual store stay with the macOS and Windows resource port, and the Work clock
gets a stand-alone copy so Work composition can schedule deadlines.
